let healthList=[{n:"games",s:games},{n:"seasonAll",s:seasonAll},{n:"scheds",s:scheds},{n:"standings",s:standings},{n:"teamsDb",s:teamsDb},{n:"extra",s:extra},{n:"liveM",s:liveM},{n:"knock",s:knock},{n:"nextup",s:nextup},{n:"histfull",s:histfull}]
let healthLabel=lang=="fr"?{games:"matchs",seasonAll:"saison",scheds:"journées",standings:"classements",teamsDb:"équipes",extra:"calendrier",liveM:"direct",knock:"arbre",nextup:"à venir",histfull:"historique"}:{games:"games",seasonAll:"season",scheds:"matchdays",standings:"tables",teamsDb:"teams",extra:"fixtures",liveM:"live",knock:"bracket",nextup:"upcoming",histfull:"history"}
let healthBad=healthList.filter(h=>h.s!=null&&!(h.s.ok??true))
let healthTxt=join(healthBad.map(h=>get(healthLabel,h.n,h.n)+" "+(h.s.code??"?"))," · ")
let healthShort="⚠ "+count(healthBad)+" · "+S.degraded
let healthLine=join(healthList.map(h=>get(healthLabel,h.n,h.n)+" "+(h.s==null?"…":(h.s.ok??false)?"✓":("✗"+(h.s.code??""))))," · ")
let gamesErr=games!=null&&!(games.ok??true)
let seasonAllErr=seasonAll!=null&&!(seasonAll.ok??true)
let extraErr=extra!=null&&!(extra.ok??true)
let nextErr=nextup!=null&&!(nextup.ok??true)
let histErr=histfull!=null&&!(histfull.ok??true)
at spinAt{if spinning{elapsed=elapsed+1;spinAt=spinAt+1}else{spinAt=0}}
on games{
lastDur=spinning?elapsed:lastDur
lastOk=(games.ok??false)
lastAt=(games.ok??false)?now:lastAt
spinning=false
spinUntil=0
spinAt=0
if (games.ok??false){
if digestOn&&digestAt==0{
let hh=int(fmtTime(now,"HH"))
let mm=int(fmtTime(now,"mm"))
digestAt=now+((hh<8?(8-hh):(32-hh))*3600-mm*60)
}
if prewarmOn&&prewarmAt==0{
let hh=int(fmtTime(now,"HH"))
let mm=int(fmtTime(now,"mm"))
prewarmAt=now+((hh<6?(6-hh):(30-hh))*3600-mm*60)
}
let ft=(value.out??[]).filter(g=>g.state=="post"&&allMine.any(a=>a.id==g.id)&&(old.out??[]).any(h=>h.id==g.id&&h.state!="post"))
let fthh=int(fmtTime(now,"HH"))
let ftQuiet=quietOn&&(fthh>=22||fthh<7)
if count(ft)>0&&!ftQuiet&&!spoiler&&now>pauseUntil&&!muteTeams.any(a=>a==(first(ft).home.abbr??"")||a==(first(ft).away.abbr??"")){let m=first(ft);notify(S.full+" · "+(m.home.score??"0")+"–"+(m.away.score??"0"),(m.tag??"")+" · "+(m.home.abbr??"")+" – "+(m.away.abbr??""))}
if soon12!=null&&!nextDone.any(d=>d==soon12.id){
h12Id=soon12.id
h12At=max(soon12.at-leadH*3600,now)
}
if kickSoon!=null&&!kickDone.any(d=>d==kickSoon.id){
kickId=kickSoon.id
kickAt=kickSoon.at
}
}
}
at spinUntil{lastDur=elapsed;lastOk=spinning?false:lastOk;spinning=false;spinUntil=0;spinAt=0}
on showTeams{draft=value?myTeams:draft;query=value?"":query}
when uiSchema<1{uiSchema=1;showTables=true;todayOnly=false;daySel=""}
when team!="ALL"&&count(myTeams)>0&&(myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==team)??null)==null{team="ALL"}
on teamsDb first{
let db=teamsDb.out??[]
myTeams=myTeams.map(t=>merge(t,{leagues:(db.find(d=>d.key==(t.key??((t.abbr??"")+":"+(t.kind??"c"))))??{}).leagues??(t.leagues??[t.league]),league:(db.find(d=>d.key==(t.key??((t.abbr??"")+":"+(t.kind??"c"))))??{}).league??t.league}))
}
on teamsDb{
let db=teamsDb.out??[]
myTeams=myTeams.map(t=>merge(t,{leagues:(db.find(d=>d.key==(t.key??((t.abbr??"")+":"+(t.kind??"c"))))??{}).leagues??(t.leagues??[t.league]),league:(db.find(d=>d.key==(t.key??((t.abbr??"")+":"+(t.kind??"c"))))??{}).league??t.league}))
}
on games first{
if (games.ok??false){
if soon12!=null&&!nextDone.any(d=>d==soon12.id){
h12Id=soon12.id
h12At=max(soon12.at-leadH*3600,now)
}
if kickSoon!=null&&!kickDone.any(d=>d==kickSoon.id){
kickId=kickSoon.id
kickAt=kickSoon.at
}
}
}
on liveM{
let before=(old??{}).items??[]
let after=value.items??[]
let hh=int(fmtTime(now,"HH"))
let quietNow=quietOn&&(hh>=22||hh<7)
let c1=after.find(g=>allMine.any(a=>a.id==g.id)&&before.any(h=>h.id==g.id&&(int(g.home.score??"0")+int(g.away.score??"0"))>(int(h.home.score??"0")+int(h.away.score??"0"))))
let c2=after.find(g=>g.id!=(c1==null?"":c1.id)&&allMine.any(a=>a.id==g.id)&&before.any(h=>h.id==g.id&&(int(g.home.score??"0")+int(g.away.score??"0"))>(int(h.home.score??"0")+int(h.away.score??"0"))))
let g1=c1==null?null:last((c1.plays??[]).filter(p=>p.goal))??null
let g2=c2==null?null:last((c2.plays??[]).filter(p=>p.goal))??null
let redM=after.find(g=>allMine.any(a=>a.id==g.id)&&(g.plays??[]).any(p=>p.red&&!(((before.find(h=>h.id==g.id)??{}).plays??[]).any(q=>q.m==p.m&&q.t==p.t&&q.who==p.who))))
let redP=redM==null?null:first((redM.plays??[]).filter(p=>p.red&&!(((before.find(h=>h.id==redM.id)??{}).plays??[]).any(q=>q.m==p.m&&q.t==p.t&&q.who==p.who))))??null
let ht=first(after.filter(g=>allMine.any(a=>a.id==g.id)&&(lower(g.detail??"")=="ht"||contains(lower(g.detail??""),"half"))&&!before.any(h=>h.id==g.id&&(lower(h.detail??"")=="ht"||contains(lower(h.detail??""),"half")))))
if c1!=null&&!spoiler&&!quietNow&&now>pauseUntil&&!muteTeams.any(a=>a==(c1.home.abbr??"")||a==(c1.away.abbr??"")){notify("⚽ "+(c1.home.score??"0")+"–"+(c1.away.score??"0")+(g1==null?"":(g1.who==null?"":" · "+g1.who)+(g1.m==null?"":" · "+g1.m)),(c1.tag??"")+" · "+(c1.home.abbr??"")+" – "+(c1.away.abbr??""))}
if c2!=null&&!spoiler&&!quietNow&&now>pauseUntil&&!muteTeams.any(a=>a==(c2.home.abbr??"")||a==(c2.away.abbr??"")){notify("⚽ "+(c2.home.score??"0")+"–"+(c2.away.score??"0")+(g2==null?"":(g2.who==null?"":" · "+g2.who)+(g2.m==null?"":" · "+g2.m)),(c2.tag??"")+" · "+(c2.home.abbr??"")+" – "+(c2.away.abbr??""))}
if redM!=null&&!spoiler&&!quietNow&&now>pauseUntil&&!muteTeams.any(a=>a==(redM.home.abbr??"")||a==(redM.away.abbr??"")){notify(S.redCard+(redP==null||redP.who==null?"":" · "+redP.who)+(redP==null||redP.m==null?"":" · "+redP.m),(redM.tag??"")+" · "+(redM.home.abbr??"")+" – "+(redM.away.abbr??""))}
if ht!=null&&!quietNow&&!spoiler&&now>pauseUntil&&!muteTeams.any(a=>a==(ht.home.abbr??"")||a==(ht.away.abbr??"")){notify(S.half+" · "+(ht.home.score??"0")+"–"+(ht.away.score??"0"),(ht.tag??"")+" · "+(ht.home.abbr??"")+" – "+(ht.away.abbr??""))}
}

at h12At{
let m=h12Match
let unseen=h12Id!=""&&!nextDone.any(d=>d==h12Id)
let fresh=m!=null&&m.state=="pre"&&m.at>now
let hh=int(fmtTime(now,"HH"))
let quietNow=quietOn&&(hh>=22||hh<7)
if unseen&&fresh&&h12Text!=""&&!quietNow&&now>pauseUntil&&!muteTeams.any(a=>a==(m.home.abbr??"")||a==(m.away.abbr??"")){notify(h12Title,h12Text)}
if unseen{
let d=flatten([nextDone,[h12Id]])
nextDone=count(d)>30?reverse(take(reverse(d),30)):d
}
h12Id="";h12At=0
}
at kickAt{
let m=kickMatch
let hh=int(fmtTime(now,"HH"))
let quietNow=quietOn&&(hh>=22||hh<7)
if m!=null&&m.state!="post"&&m.at>now-900&&kickText!=""&&!quietNow&&now>pauseUntil&&!muteTeams.any(a=>a==(m.home.abbr??"")||a==(m.away.abbr??"")){notify(kickTitle,kickText)}
let d=flatten([kickDone,[kickId]])
kickDone=count(d)>30?reverse(take(reverse(d),30)):d
kickId="";kickAt=0
}
at digestAt{
if digestOn{
let hh=int(fmtTime(now,"HH"))
let d0=now-(hh*3600+int(fmtTime(now,"mm"))*60)
let todayM=allMine.filter(g=>g.at>=d0&&g.at<d0+86400).sortBy(g=>g.at)
let line=join(todayM.take(3).map(g=>fmtTime(g.at,"HH:mm")+" "+g.home.abbr+"–"+g.away.abbr)," · ")
if line!=""{notify(S.dailyTitle,line+(count(todayM)>3?" +"+(count(todayM)-3):""))}
if weeklyOn&&fmtTime(now,"EEE",null,"en")=="Mon"{
let weekM=allMine.filter(g=>g.at>=d0&&g.at<d0+7*86400).sortBy(g=>g.at)
let wline=join(weekM.take(5).map(g=>fmtTime(g.at,"EEE d/MM HH:mm",null,lang)+" "+g.home.abbr+"–"+g.away.abbr)," · ")
if wline!=""{notify(S.weekTitle,wline)}
}
}
digestAt=now+86400
}
at prewarmAt{
if prewarmOn{refresh()}
prewarmAt=now+86400
}
let favAbbrs=myTeams.map(t=>t.abbr)
let selTeam=myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==team)??null
let setupNeeded=count(myTeams)==0||showTeams
let gAdv=(games.out??[]).filter(g=>g.state!='pre'||!(extra.out??[]).any(e=>e.id==g.id))
let eKeep=(extra.out??[]).filter(e=>!gAdv.any(g=>g.id==e.id))
let allRaw=flatten([gAdv,eKeep,(seasonAll.out??[]).filter(s=>!gAdv.any(g=>g.id==s.id)&&!eKeep.any(e=>e.id==s.id))]).filter(g=>g.state!='pre'||g.at>now-7200||contains(lower(g.detail??""),"postpon")||contains(lower(g.detail??""),"cancel")||contains(lower(g.detail??""),"susp"))
let all=values(groupBy(allRaw,g=>g.id)).map(a=>first(a)).sortBy(g=>g.at)
let rounds=scheds.out.rounds??{}
let anchors=scheds.out.anchors??{}
let eurBase=all.filter(g=>g.league=='uefa.europa').sortBy(g=>g.at)
let eurIds=eurBase.map(g=>g.id)
let tables=standings.out??[]
let live=all.filter(g=>g.state=='in')
let allMine=all.filter(g=>count(myTeams)>0&&(count(g.tids??[])>0?((g.tids??[]).any(s=>myTeams.any(t=>(t.tid??"")!=""&&t.tid==s&&t.kind==(g.league=="uefa.nations"||g.league=="fifa.worldq.uefa"||g.league=="fifa.friendly"?"n":"c")))||(g.squads??[]).any(s=>myTeams.any(t=>(t.tid??"")==""&&t.abbr==s&&t.kind==(g.league=="uefa.nations"||g.league=="fifa.worldq.uefa"||g.league=="fifa.friendly"?"n":"c")))):((g.squads??[]).any(s=>myTeams.any(t=>t.abbr==s&&t.kind==(g.league=="uefa.nations"||g.league=="fifa.worldq.uefa"||g.league=="fifa.friendly"?"n":"c"))))))
let cal=range(7).map(i=>({k:fmtTime(now+i*86400,"yyyy-MM-dd"),d:fmtTime(now+i*86400,"EEE",null,lang),n:count(allMine.filter(g=>fmtTime(g.at,"yyyy-MM-dd")==fmtTime(now+i*86400,"yyyy-MM-dd")))}))
let prefetchMatches=flatten(myTeams.map(t=>[first(allMine.filter(g=>g.state=="pre"&&g.at>now&&(g.squads??[]).any(s=>s==t.abbr)).sortBy(g=>g.at))])).filter(g=>g!=null)
let prefetchArg=join(prefetchMatches.map(g=>g.league+"|"+g.id+"|"+(g.at??0)+"|"+(g.home.abbr??""))," ")
let baseRaw=team=="ALL"?allMine:allMine.filter(g=>((count(g.tids??[])>0&&selTeam!=null&&(selTeam.tid??"")!=""?(g.tids??[]).any(s=>s==selTeam.tid):(g.squads??[]).any(s=>s==team))&&(selTeam==null||(g.league=="uefa.nations"||g.league=="fifa.worldq.uefa"||g.league=="fifa.friendly"?"n":"c")==(selTeam.kind??"c"))))
let base=todayOnly?baseRaw.filter(g=>fmtTime(g.at,"yyyy-MM-dd")==fmtTime(now,"yyyy-MM-dd")):(daySel!=""?baseRaw.filter(g=>fmtTime(g.at,"yyyy-MM-dd")==daySel):baseRaw)
let filterOn=todayOnly||daySel!=""
let filterLabel=todayOnly?S.todayOnly:daySel
let baseF=base
let liveF=baseF.filter(g=>g.state=='in')
let nextF=baseF.filter(g=>g.state=='pre')
let pastA=baseF.filter(g=>g.state=='post')
let upShow=flatten([liveF,nextF])
let heroMatch=first(upShow.sortBy(g=>g.at))
let matchday=count(liveF)>0||(heroMatch!=null&&heroMatch.at-now>=-10800&&heroMatch.at-now<=7200)

let upTile=compactMode||(matchdayMode&&matchday)?upShow.sortBy(g=>g.at).take(5):upShow.sortBy(g=>g.at)
let notDone=allMine.filter(g=>g.state=="pre"&&g.at>now&&!nextDone.any(d=>d==g.id))
let soon12=first(notDone.sortBy(g=>g.at))
let kickSoon=first(allMine.filter(g=>g.state=="pre"&&g.at>now).sortBy(g=>g.at))
let h12Match=all.find(g=>g.id==h12Id)
let kickMatch=all.find(g=>g.id==kickId)
let hKind=h12Match==null?"c":h12Match.league=="uefa.nations"||h12Match.league=="fifa.worldq.uefa"||h12Match.league=="fifa.friendly"?"n":"c"
let hTeamH=h12Match==null||h12Match.home==null?{abbr:"",short:"",kind:hKind}:(myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==h12Match.home.abbr&&t.kind==hKind)??{abbr:h12Match.home.abbr,short:h12Match.home.abbr,kind:hKind})
let hTeamA=h12Match==null||h12Match.away==null?{abbr:"",short:"",kind:hKind}:(myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==h12Match.away.abbr&&t.kind==hKind)??{abbr:h12Match.away.abbr,short:h12Match.away.abbr,kind:hKind})
let hShortH=hTeamH.short??hTeamH.abbr
let hShortA=hTeamA.short??hTeamA.abbr
let h12Duel=h12Match==null||h12Match.home==null||h12Match.away==null?"":hShortH+" – "+hShortA
let h12Title=h12Duel==""?"":hShortH+" ⚔️ "+hShortA
let h12Text=h12Duel==""?"":(h12Match.tag==null||h12Match.tag==""?"":h12Match.tag+" · ")+fmtTime(h12Match.at,"EEE d/MM HH:mm",null,lang)+" · "+S.inPrep+fmtDuration(max(h12Match.at-now,60))
let kKind=kickMatch==null?"c":kickMatch.league=="uefa.nations"||kickMatch.league=="fifa.worldq.uefa"||kickMatch.league=="fifa.friendly"?"n":"c"
let kTeamH=kickMatch==null||kickMatch.home==null?{abbr:"",short:"",kind:kKind}:(myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==kickMatch.home.abbr&&t.kind==kKind)??{abbr:kickMatch.home.abbr,short:kickMatch.home.abbr,kind:kKind})
let kTeamA=kickMatch==null||kickMatch.away==null?{abbr:"",short:"",kind:kKind}:(myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==kickMatch.away.abbr&&t.kind==kKind)??{abbr:kickMatch.away.abbr,short:kickMatch.away.abbr,kind:kKind})
let kShortH=kTeamH.short??kTeamH.abbr
let kShortA=kTeamA.short??kTeamA.abbr
let kickTitle=kickMatch==null?"":kShortH+" ⚔️ "+kShortA
let kickText=kickMatch==null||kickMatch.home==null||kickMatch.away==null?"":S.kickStart+fmtTime(kickMatch.at,"HH:mm")+(kickMatch.tag==null||kickMatch.tag==""?"":" · "+kickMatch.tag)
let liveList=liveM.out.items??[]
let liveAt=liveM.out.at??0
let liveAge=liveAt>0?max(now-liveAt,0):null
let liveSuffix=liveAge==null?"":" · live "+agoP+fmtDuration(liveAge)+agoS
let statusTxt=spinning?S.refreshing+elapsed+"s":lastOk==false?S.fail:lastAt>0?S.updated+" · "+agoP+fmtDuration(max(now-(lastAt??now),0))+agoS:S.tapRefresh
let liveWarn=liveAge!=null&&liveAge>900?" · "+(lang=="fr"?"màj ":"updated ")+agoP+fmtDuration(liveAge)+agoS:""
let total=count(baseF)
let pastTake=(compactMode||(matchdayMode&&matchday))?[]:(count(pastA)<=5?pastA:pastA.sortBy(g=>-g.at).take(5).sortBy(g=>g.at))
let wide=max(max(screenWidth??0,tileWidth??0),240)>=280
let fz=uiSize=="S"?12:uiSize=="L"?15:uiSize=="XL"?17:13
let heroH=heroMatch==null||heroMatch.home==null?"":(myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==heroMatch.home.abbr).short??(wide?(heroMatch.home.name??heroMatch.home.abbr):heroMatch.home.abbr))
let heroA=heroMatch==null||heroMatch.away==null?"":(myTeams.find(t=>t.abbr==heroMatch.away.abbr).short??(wide?(heroMatch.away.name??heroMatch.away.abbr):heroMatch.away.abbr))
let heroHLogo=heroMatch==null||heroMatch.home==null?"":heroMatch.home.logo??""
let heroALogo=heroMatch==null||heroMatch.away==null?"":heroMatch.away.logo??""
let heroOddsScript="""    LG="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"":(heroMatch.league??""))+""";
    ID="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"":(heroMatch.id??""))+""";
    AT="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"0":(heroMatch.at??0))+""";
    ST="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"":(heroMatch.state??""))+""";
    HID="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"":(heroMatch.home==null?"":(heroMatch.home.tid??"")))+""";
    HABBR="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"":(heroMatch.home==null?"":(heroMatch.home.abbr??"")))+""";
    if [ "$ST" != "pre" ] || [ -z "$LG" ] || [ -z "$ID" ]; then printf 'null'; exit 0; fi
    RAW=${ID#*:}
    C=~/.cache/espn-odds
    mkdir -p "$C"
    F="$C/$LG-$RAW.json"
    NOW=$(date +%s)
    TTL=21600
    if [ "$AT" -gt 0 ] 2>/dev/null; then LEFT=$((AT-NOW)); if [ "$LEFT" -lt 43200 ] && [ "$LEFT" -gt -7200 ]; then TTL=3600; fi; fi
    if [ -s "$F" ]; then
      TS=$(jq -r '.ts // 0' "$F" 2>/dev/null)
      CA=$(jq -r '.at // 0' "$F" 2>/dev/null)
      if [ -n "$TS" ] && [ "$TS" != "null" ] && [ "$CA" != "0" ] && [ $((NOW-TS)) -lt "$TTL" ] && [ "$(jq -r '.hv // 0' "$F" 2>/dev/null)" = "1" ] && [ "$(jq -r '.sv // 0' "$F" 2>/dev/null)" = "3" ]; then cp "$F" "$C/current.tmp" && mv "$C/current.tmp" "$C/current.json"; cat "$F"; exit 0; fi
    fi
    OUT=$(curl --proto '=https' --max-redirs 0 --max-filesize 2097152 --connect-timeout 5 --retry 0 -fsm 10 --compressed "https://site.api.espn.com/apis/site/v2/sports/soccer/$LG/summary?event=$RAW" 2>/dev/null | jq -c --arg lg "$LG" --arg id "$RAW" --argjson ts "$NOW" --arg hid "$HID" --arg habbr "$HABBR" 'def dec: ((tostring) | if startswith("+") then .[1:] else . end | (try tonumber catch null)) as $n | if $n == null or $n == 0 then null elif $n > 0 then 1 + ($n / 100) else 1 + (100 / (0 - $n)) end; def O: ([.odds[]? | select(. != null and .moneyline != null)][0]) as $o | if $o == null then null else {h: (($o.moneyline.home.close.odds // $o.moneyline.home.open.odds // $o.homeTeamOdds.moneyLine // null) | dec), d: (($o.moneyline.draw.close.odds // $o.moneyline.draw.open.odds // $o.drawOdds.moneyLine // null) | dec), a: (($o.moneyline.away.close.odds // $o.moneyline.away.open.odds // $o.awayTeamOdds.moneyLine // null) | dec), ho: (($o.moneyline.home.open.odds // null) | dec), do: (($o.moneyline.draw.open.odds // null) | dec), ao: (($o.moneyline.away.open.odds // null) | dec), tot: (($o.total.over.close.line // "") | sub("^[ou]";"") | (try tonumber catch null)), tov: ($o.total.over.close.odds | dec), tun: (($o.total.under.close.line // "") | sub("^[ou]";"") | (try tonumber catch null)), tuv: ($o.total.under.close.odds | dec), sph: (($o.pointSpread.home.close.line // "") | (try tonumber catch null)), sphv: ($o.pointSpread.home.close.odds | dec), spa: (($o.pointSpread.away.close.line // "") | (try tonumber catch null)), spav: ($o.pointSpread.away.close.odds | dec)} end; {id: ($lg + ":" + $id), ts: $ts, date: (.header.competitions[0].date? // null), at: ((.header.competitions[0].date? // "") | sub("Z$"; ":00Z") | (try fromdateiso8601 catch null)), odds: O, hv: 1, sv: 3, state: (.header.competitions[0].status.type.state // null), info: {venue: (.gameInfo.venue.fullName? // null), city: (.gameInfo.venue.address.city? // null), attendance: (.gameInfo.attendance? // null), referee: ((.gameInfo.referee.displayName? // .gameInfo.referee.name?) // null)}, stats: ([.boxscore.teams[]? | {team: (.team.abbreviation // ""), st: [.statistics[]? | {l: (.label // .name // ""), v: (.displayValue // (.value|tostring))}][0:12]}] // []), leaders: ([.leaders[]? | {t:(.team.abbreviation//""), n:(.name//.displayName//""), l:[(.leaders//[])[]? | {n:(.athlete.displayName//.fullName//""), v:(.displayValue//""), s:(.shortDisplayName//"")}][0:3]}][0:4]//[]), injuries: ([.injuries[]? | {t:(.team.abbreviation//""), n:(.athlete.displayName//""), s:(.status//""), d:(.details//"")}][0:6]//[]), events: ([.commentary[]? | select((.play.type.type // "") | test("goal|card|substitution|penalty")) | {m: (.time.displayValue // ""), x: (.text // "")}][0:8] // []), lineups: ([.rosters[]? | {t: (.team.abbreviation // ""), f: (.formation // ""), p: [(.roster // [])[]? | select(.starter == true) | {n: (.athlete.displayName // ""), j: (.jersey // "")}][0:11]}] // []), news: ([.news.articles[]? | {h: (.headline // ""), d: (.description // "")}][0:2] // []), h2h: (([.seasonseries[]? | select((.type? // "") == "head-to-head")][0]) as $s | if $s == null then null else (($s.events // []) | length) as $n | ([$s.events[]? | .competitors as $cs | select([$cs[] | select((((.team.id|tostring)==$hid) or ((.team.abbreviation? // "")==$habbr))) | .winner] | any)] | length) as $w | ([$s.events[]? | .competitors as $cs | select([$cs[] | select((((.team.id|tostring)!=$hid) and ((.team.abbreviation? // "")!=$habbr))) | .winner] | any)] | length) as $l | {n: $n, w: $w, d: ($n - $w - $l), l: $l, last: (((($s.events // []) | .[0]) as $e | if $e == null then null else {hs: ([$e.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="home") | .score][0] // null), as: ([$e.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="away") | .score][0] // null), won: ([$e.competitors[]? | select((((.team.id|tostring)==$hid) or ((.team.abbreviation? // "")==$habbr))) | .winner] | any)} end)), list: ([($s.events // [])[]? | {d: (.date[0:10] // ""), hs: (([.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="home") | .score][0]) // null), a: (([.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="away") | .score][0]) // null), w: ([.competitors[]? | select((((.team.id|tostring)==$hid) or ((.team.abbreviation? // "")==$habbr))) | .winner] | any)}] | .[0:5])} end)}')
    if [ -n "$OUT" ] && [ "$OUT" != "null" ]; then
      printf '%s\n' "$OUT" > "$F.tmp" && mv "$F.tmp" "$F"
      printf '%s\n' "$OUT" > "$C/current.tmp" && mv "$C/current.tmp" "$C/current.json"
      printf '%s\n' "$OUT"
    elif [ -s "$F" ]; then
      cp "$F" "$C/current.tmp" && mv "$C/current.tmp" "$C/current.json"
      cat "$F"
    else
      printf 'null'
    fi
    find "$C" -type f -name '*.json' -mtime +7 -delete 2>/dev/null
"""
let bannerScript="""    HL="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"":(heroMatch.home==null?"":(heroMatch.home.logo??"")))+""";
    AL="""+sh(heroMatch==null?"":(heroMatch.away==null?"":(heroMatch.away.logo??"")))+""";
    [ -n "$HL$AL" ] || { printf 'ok'; exit 0; }
    B=~/.cache/espn-logos/banner
    mkdir -p "$B"
    dims_ok() {
      [ -s "$1" ] || return 1
      W=$(od -An -N4 -j16 -tu1 "$1" 2>/dev/null | awk '{print $1*16777216+$2*65536+$3*256+$4}')
      [ "${W:-0}" -ge 160 ] 2>/dev/null
    }
    for f in "$HL" "$AL"; do
      [ -n "$f" ] || continue
      if ! dims_ok "$B/$f"; then
        p=$(echo "$f" | tr '-' '/')
        t="$B/.$f.$$.tmp"
        if curl --proto '=https' --max-redirs 0 --max-filesize 2097152 --connect-timeout 5 -fsm 10 "https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=/i/teamlogos/$p&w=160&h=160" -o "$t" 2>/dev/null && [ -s "$t" ]; then mv "$t" "$B/$f"; else rm -f "$t"; [ -s ~/.cache/espn-logos/soccer/$f ] && cp ~/.cache/espn-logos/soccer/$f "$B/$f"; fi
      fi
    done
    find "$B" -type f -mtime +60 -delete 2>/dev/null
    printf 'ok'
"""
source bannerLogos=cmd("bash -c ${sh(bannerScript)}")every 1h timeout 60s
let prefetchScript="""    NEXT="""+sh(prefetchArg)+""";
    [ -n "$NEXT" ] || { printf 'ok'; exit 0; }
    C=~/.cache/espn-odds
    mkdir -p "$C"
    NOW=$(date +%s)
    for e in $NEXT; do
      LG=${e%%|*}; rest=${e#*|}; ID=${rest%%|*}; rest=${rest#*|}; AT=${rest%%|*}; HABBR=${rest#*|}
      RAW=${ID#*:}
      F="$C/$LG-$RAW.json"
      if [ -s "$F" ]; then
        TS=$(jq -r '.ts // 0' "$F" 2>/dev/null)
        HV=$(jq -r '.hv // 0' "$F" 2>/dev/null)
        SV=$(jq -r '.sv // 0' "$F" 2>/dev/null)
        if [ -n "$TS" ] && [ "$TS" != "null" ] && [ "$HV" = "1" ] && [ "$SV" = "3" ] && [ $((NOW-TS)) -lt 21600 ]; then continue; fi
      fi
      OUT=$(curl --proto '=https' --max-redirs 0 --max-filesize 2097152 --connect-timeout 5 --retry 0 -fsm 10 --compressed "https://site.api.espn.com/apis/site/v2/sports/soccer/$LG/summary?event=$RAW" 2>/dev/null | jq -c --arg lg "$LG" --arg id "$RAW" --argjson ts "$NOW" --arg hid "" --arg habbr "$HABBR" 'def dec: ((tostring) | if startswith("+") then .[1:] else . end | (try tonumber catch null)) as $n | if $n == null or $n == 0 then null elif $n > 0 then 1 + ($n / 100) else 1 + (100 / (0 - $n)) end; def O: ([.odds[]? | select(. != null and .moneyline != null)][0]) as $o | if $o == null then null else {h: (($o.moneyline.home.close.odds // $o.moneyline.home.open.odds // $o.homeTeamOdds.moneyLine // null) | dec), d: (($o.moneyline.draw.close.odds // $o.moneyline.draw.open.odds // $o.drawOdds.moneyLine // null) | dec), a: (($o.moneyline.away.close.odds // $o.moneyline.away.open.odds // $o.awayTeamOdds.moneyLine // null) | dec), ho: (($o.moneyline.home.open.odds // null) | dec), do: (($o.moneyline.draw.open.odds // null) | dec), ao: (($o.moneyline.away.open.odds // null) | dec), tot: (($o.total.over.close.line // "") | sub("^[ou]";"") | (try tonumber catch null)), tov: ($o.total.over.close.odds | dec), tun: (($o.total.under.close.line // "") | sub("^[ou]";"") | (try tonumber catch null)), tuv: ($o.total.under.close.odds | dec), sph: (($o.pointSpread.home.close.line // "") | (try tonumber catch null)), sphv: ($o.pointSpread.home.close.odds | dec), spa: (($o.pointSpread.away.close.line // "") | (try tonumber catch null)), spav: ($o.pointSpread.away.close.odds | dec)} end; {id: ($lg + ":" + $id), ts: $ts, date: (.header.competitions[0].date? // null), at: ((.header.competitions[0].date? // "") | sub("Z$"; ":00Z") | (try fromdateiso8601 catch null)), odds: O, hv: 1, sv: 3, state: (.header.competitions[0].status.type.state // null), info: {venue: (.gameInfo.venue.fullName? // null), city: (.gameInfo.venue.address.city? // null), attendance: (.gameInfo.attendance? // null), referee: ((.gameInfo.referee.displayName? // .gameInfo.referee.name?) // null)}, stats: ([.boxscore.teams[]? | {team: (.team.abbreviation // ""), st: [.statistics[]? | {l: (.label // .name // ""), v: (.displayValue // (.value|tostring))}][0:12]}] // []), leaders: ([.leaders[]? | {t:(.team.abbreviation//""), n:(.name//.displayName//""), l:[(.leaders//[])[]? | {n:(.athlete.displayName//.fullName//""), v:(.displayValue//""), s:(.shortDisplayName//"")}][0:3]}][0:4]//[]), injuries: ([.injuries[]? | {t:(.team.abbreviation//""), n:(.athlete.displayName//""), s:(.status//""), d:(.details//"")}][0:6]//[]), events: ([.commentary[]? | select((.play.type.type // "") | test("goal|card|substitution|penalty")) | {m: (.time.displayValue // ""), x: (.text // "")}][0:8] // []), lineups: ([.rosters[]? | {t: (.team.abbreviation // ""), f: (.formation // ""), p: [(.roster // [])[]? | select(.starter == true) | {n: (.athlete.displayName // ""), j: (.jersey // "")}][0:11]}] // []), news: ([.news.articles[]? | {h: (.headline // ""), d: (.description // "")}][0:2] // []), h2h: (([.seasonseries[]? | select((.type? // "") == "head-to-head")][0]) as $s | if $s == null then null else (($s.events // []) | length) as $n | ([$s.events[]? | .competitors as $cs | select([$cs[] | select((((.team.id|tostring)==$hid) or ((.team.abbreviation? // "")==$habbr))) | .winner] | any)] | length) as $w | ([$s.events[]? | .competitors as $cs | select([$cs[] | select((((.team.id|tostring)!=$hid) and ((.team.abbreviation? // "")!=$habbr))) | .winner] | any)] | length) as $l | {n: $n, w: $w, d: ($n - $w - $l), l: $l, last: (((($s.events // []) | .[0]) as $e | if $e == null then null else {hs: ([$e.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="home") | .score][0] // null), as: ([$e.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="away") | .score][0] // null), won: ([$e.competitors[]? | select((((.team.id|tostring)==$hid) or ((.team.abbreviation? // "")==$habbr))) | .winner] | any)} end)), list: ([($s.events // [])[]? | {d: (.date[0:10] // ""), hs: (([.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="home") | .score][0]) // null), a: (([.competitors[]? | select(.homeAway=="away") | .score][0]) // null), w: ([.competitors[]? | select((((.team.id|tostring)==$hid) or ((.team.abbreviation? // "")==$habbr))) | .winner] | any)}] | .[0:5])} end)}')
      if [ -n "$OUT" ] && [ "$OUT" != "null" ]; then printf '%s\n' "$OUT" > "$F.tmp" && mv "$F.tmp" "$F"; fi
    done
    printf 'ok'
"""
source prefetch=cmd("bash -c ${sh(prefetchScript)}")every 1h timeout 120s
source heroOdds=cmd("bash -c ${sh(heroOddsScript)}")every 1h json timeout 20s
source oddsNow=file("~/.cache/espn-odds/current.json")json
source h2hNow=file(heroMatch==null?null:"~/.cache/espn-odds/"+(heroMatch.league??"")+"-"+(replace((heroMatch.id??""),(heroMatch.league??"")+":",""))+".json")json
let heroAt=heroMatch==null?0:((oddsNow??{}).id==heroMatch.id&&oddsNow.at!=null?oddsNow.at:(heroOdds!=null&&heroOdds.id==heroMatch.id&&heroOdds.at!=null?heroOdds.at:heroMatch.at))
let heroTime=heroMatch==null?"":heroMatch.state=="in"?(heroMatch.detail??""):fmtTime(heroAt,"HH:mm")
let heroTag=heroMatch==null||heroMatch.tag==null||heroMatch.tag==""?"":heroMatch.tag
let heroDay=heroMatch==null||heroMatch.state=="in"?"":fmtTime(heroAt,"d MMM",null,lang)
let heroTagLine=heroDay==""?heroTag:(heroTag==""?heroDay:heroTag+" · "+heroDay)
let heroDown=heroMatch==null?"":heroMatch.state=="in"?S.liveNowB:heroAt-now<0?S.liveNowB:heroAt-now<60?S.startingNow:S.kickoffIn+fmtDuration(heroAt-now)
let liveBadge=count(liveF)>0?"● "+S.liveWord+" "+count(liveF):""
let heroOddObj=heroMatch!=null&&(oddsNow??{}).id==heroMatch.id?oddsNow:(heroMatch!=null&&(heroOdds??{}).id==heroMatch.id?heroOdds:null)
let heroH2HObj=heroMatch!=null&&(h2hNow??{}).id==heroMatch.id?h2hNow:heroOddObj
let od1=heroOddObj==null?null:heroOddObj.odds
let noVig=od1==null||od1.h==null||od1.d==null||od1.a==null||od1.h<=0||od1.d<=0||od1.a<=0?null:{h:round(100/od1.h/(1/od1.h+1/od1.d+1/od1.a)),d:round(100/od1.d/(1/od1.h+1/od1.d+1/od1.a)),a:round(100/od1.a/(1/od1.h+1/od1.d+1/od1.a))}
let noVigTxt=noVig==null?"":"1 "+noVig.h+"% · N "+noVig.d+"% · 2 "+noVig.a+"%"
let moveH=od1==null||od1.ho==null||od1.h==null?0:od1.h-od1.ho
let moveA=od1==null||od1.ao==null||od1.a==null?0:od1.a-od1.ao
let moveTxt=od1==null||(moveH==0&&moveA==0)?"":"1 "+(moveH<0?"▼":moveH>0?"▲":"·")+" · 2 "+(moveA<0?"▼":moveA>0?"▲":"·")
let heroH2H=heroH2HObj!=null&&heroH2HObj.h2h!=null?(lang=="fr"?"H2H · "+heroH2HObj.h2h.w+"V "+heroH2HObj.h2h.d+"N "+heroH2HObj.h2h.l+"D":"H2H · "+heroH2HObj.h2h.w+"W "+heroH2HObj.h2h.d+"D "+heroH2HObj.h2h.l+"L"):""
